  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Cyclone Ian Reconstruction and Climate Resilience Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Project are to: (a) strengthen the climate resilience of housing and selected community facilities for the affected population of Ha&#xe2;&#x80;&#x99;apai; and (b) strengthen the Recipient&#xe2;&#x80;&#x99;s preparedness to recover from future natural disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
